1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:04,351
Grandma June can't see her porch. Jo wants to fix that without a monthly bill.

2
00:00:04,851 --> 00:00:06,013
Tuesday, 2:10 p.m.

3
00:00:06,413 --> 00:00:07,993
Was someone at the door?

4
00:00:08,393 --> 00:00:10,547
Grandma, let's get you a video doorbell.

5
00:00:10,947 --> 00:00:14,228
The catch: many doorbells save video only if you pay for a plan.

6
00:00:14,628 --> 00:00:19,516
Saved video costs extra. Ring Solo is $49.99 a year, says ring.com.

7
00:00:19,916 --> 00:00:26,353
Over three years, Ring with the Pro plan is $639.96 based on Target and maker prices, November 11, 2026.

8
00:00:26,753 --> 00:00:30,286
$639.96 to watch Grandma's porch?!

9
00:00:30,686 --> 00:00:35,406
The eufy E340 saves about 90 days of clips on 8 GB inside it. No fee, per eufy.

10
00:00:35,806 --> 00:00:39,146
Look at you, my little engineer.

11
00:00:39,546 --> 00:00:41,389
I can see the whole porch!

12
00:00:41,789 --> 00:00:44,555
At a busy door, owners get weeks of charge, not months.

13
00:00:44,675 --> 00:00:46,346
I'll charge it on Sundays, when I visit.

14
00:00:46,746 --> 00:00:48,649
I know exactly who that is.

15
00:00:49,049 --> 00:00:52,454
Which doorbell works without a plan? Full guide and sources: link in the description.

